          "source_segment_id": "seg-f2bfed0886bd4c1e4a5d46f4",
          "source_text_sha256": "47fbe4df092e12f29a49419d677776a1db3890e17bd58a0e92cacf4d5d274662",
          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observations of the passage of a polygonal and sparkling object in the sky; rotation on its transverse axis: probable observations of a light debris (unknown origin).",
